<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">

<title>Pemodelan dengan Fungsi Trigonometri</title>
<metadata>
  <md:content-id>m49399</md:content-id>
  <md:title>Pemodelan dengan Fungsi Trigonometri</md:title>
  <md:abstract><para id="para-00001">Di bagian ini, Anda akan:</para><list id="list-00001">
<item>Menentukan amplitudo dan periode fungsi sinusoidal.</item>
<item>Memodelkan persamaan dan menggambar grafik fungsi sinusoidal.</item>
<item>Memodelkan perilaku periodik.</item>
<item>Memodelkan fungsi gerak harmonik.</item>
</list></md:abstract>
  <md:uuid>22b551db-3bff-46ef-8450-d1830461fcae</md:uuid>
</metadata>

<content>
<figure id="Figure_07_06_001" class="small"><media id="fs-id1478255" alt="Foto bagian atas jam.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_06_001.jpg" />
</media>

<caption>Jarum-jarum jam bergerak secara periodik: posisinya berulang setiap dua belas jam. (kredit: “zoutedrop”/Flickr)</caption></figure><para id="fs-id1334861">Misalkan kita membuat grafik suhu rata-rata harian di Kota New York selama satu tahun. Suhu terendah diperkirakan terjadi pada Januari dan Februari, sedangkan suhu tertinggi pada Juli dan Agustus. Siklus yang sudah dikenal ini berulang dari tahun ke tahun; jika grafik diperpanjang untuk beberapa tahun, bentuknya akan menyerupai fungsi periodik.</para>
<para id="fs-id1223486">Banyak fenomena alam lainnya juga bersifat periodik. Sebagai contoh, fase Bulan memiliki periode sekitar 28 hari, dan burung-burung mengetahui saat yang hampir sama setiap tahun untuk terbang ke selatan.</para>
<para id="fs-id1783046">Lalu, bagaimana kita dapat memodelkan persamaan yang mencerminkan perilaku periodik? Pertama, kita harus mengumpulkan dan mencatat data. Kemudian kita menentukan fungsi yang menyerupai pola yang diamati. Terakhir, kita melakukan perubahan yang diperlukan pada fungsi tersebut untuk memperoleh model yang andal. Dalam bagian ini, kita akan mengkaji lebih mendalam jenis-jenis perilaku periodik tertentu dan memodelkan persamaan yang sesuai dengan data.</para>

<section id="fs-id1869629">
<title>Menentukan Amplitudo dan Periode Fungsi Sinusoidal</title>
<para id="fs-id2135247">Setiap gerak yang berulang dalam selang waktu tetap dianggap sebagai <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00001">gerak periodik</term> dan dapat dimodelkan dengan suatu <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00002">fungsi sinusoidal</term>. <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00003">amplitudo</term> suatu fungsi sinusoidal adalah jarak dari garis tengah ke nilai maksimum, atau dari garis tengah ke nilai minimum. <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00004">garis tengah</term> adalah nilai rata-rata. Fungsi sinusoidal berosilasi di atas dan di bawah garis tengah, bersifat periodik, dan mengulangi nilai dalam siklus-siklus tertentu. Ingat kembali dari <link document="m49387">Grafik Fungsi Sinus dan Kosinus</link> bahwa <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00005">periode</term> fungsi sinus dan fungsi kosinus adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Dengan kata lain, untuk setiap nilai <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para><equation id="fs-id1776567" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>k</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mtext>    dan    </m:mtext><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>k</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mtext>    di mana </m:mtext><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mtext> adalah bilangan bulat</m:mtext>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </equation><note id="fs-id2184994"><title>Bentuk Standar Persamaan Sinusoidal</title>


<para id="eip-id1963147">Bentuk umum persamaan sinusoidal diberikan sebagai</para>
<equation id="Equation_07_06_01" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mtext> atau </m:mtext><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </equation><para id="fs-id1479408">di mana <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtext>amplitudo</m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>|</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mo>|</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> berkaitan dengan periode sedemikian sehingga <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtext> periode</m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mi>B</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> adalah pergeseran fase sedemikian sehingga <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>C</m:mi>
   <m:mi>B</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> menunjukkan pergeseran horizontal, dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>D</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> menyatakan pergeseran vertikal dari grafik fungsi dasarnya.</para><para id="fs-id1581750">Perhatikan bahwa model kadang ditulis sebagai <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>ω</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> atau <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>ω</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan periode diberikan sebagai <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para><para id="fs-id3244738">Perbedaan grafik sinus dan kosinus adalah bahwa grafik sinus bermula pada nilai rata-rata fungsi, sedangkan grafik kosinus bermula pada nilai maksimum atau minimum fungsi.</para>
</note><example id="Example_07_06_01">
<exercise id="fs-id1724703"><problem id="fs-id1250285">
<title>Menunjukkan Cara Sifat-Sifat Fungsi Trigonometri Mentransformasi Grafik</title>
<para id="fs-id1774466">Tunjukkan transformasi grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> menjadi grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2.</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2165557">
<para id="fs-id1161847">Perhatikan rangkaian grafik pada <link target-id="Figure_07_06_010" /> dan bagaimana setiap perubahan pada persamaan mengubah grafiknya.</para>

<figure id="Figure_07_06_010"><media id="fs-id1542557" alt="Lima grafik berjajar, masing-masing menunjukkan perubahan terhadap grafik sebelumnya. (A) memuat y=sin(x). (B) memuat y=2sin(x), dengan amplitudo dua kali lipat. (C) memuat y=2sin(4x), dengan frekuensi empat kali lipat (atau periode seperempatnya). (D) memuat y=2sin(4x-pi/2), yang digeser sepanjang sumbu x sebesar pi/2. (E) memuat y=2sin(4x-pi/2) + 2, yang digeser sepanjang sumbu y sebesar 2.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_06_010.jpg" />
</media>

<caption>(a) Grafik dasar <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> (b) Mengubah amplitudo dari 1 menjadi 2 menghasilkan grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> (c) Periode fungsi sinus berubah dengan nilai <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> sedemikian sehingga <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtext> periode</m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mi>B</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Di sini kita memiliki <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> yang menghasilkan periode <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Grafik menyelesaikan satu siklus penuh dalam <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> satuan. (d) Grafik menunjukkan pergeseran horizontal sebesar <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>C</m:mi>
   <m:mi>B</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> atau <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>8</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> (e) Terakhir, grafik digeser secara vertikal sebesar nilai <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Dalam kasus ini, grafik digeser ke atas sebesar 2 satuan.</caption></figure></solution>
</exercise></example>

<example id="Example_07_06_02">
<exercise id="fs-id2050733">
<problem id="fs-id2252312">
<title>Menentukan Amplitudo dan Periode Fungsi</title>
<para id="fs-id2861515">Tentukan amplitudo dan periode fungsi-fungsi berikut, lalu gambarkan satu siklusnya.</para>
<list id="fs-id2883857" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mn>1</m:mn>
     <m:mn>4</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math></item>
</list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1364717">
<para id="fs-id1406955">Kita akan menyelesaikan soal-soal ini berdasarkan model yang sesuai.</para>
<list id="fs-id2612617" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mn>1</m:mn>
     <m:mn>4</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> melibatkan sinus, sehingga kita menggunakan bentuk
<equation id="fs-id1121414" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </equation>
<para id="fs-id2887184">Kita mengetahui bahwa <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="true">|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo stretchy="true">|</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> adalah amplitudo, sehingga amplitudonya 2. Periodenya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mi>B</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> sehingga periodenya adalah</para>

<equation id="fs-id1297540" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mi>B</m:mi>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>     </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </equation>

<para id="fs-id1290632">Lihat grafik di <link target-id="Figure_07_06_002" />.</para>

<figure id="Figure_07_06_002" class="small"><media id="fs-id1079211" alt="Grafik y=2sin(1/4 x) dari 0 hingga 8pi, yang merupakan satu siklus. Amplitudonya 2 dan periodenya 8pi.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_06_002.jpg" />
</media>
</figure></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> melibatkan sinus, sehingga kita menggunakan bentuk
<equation id="fs-id1342014" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </equation>
<para id="fs-id1082816">Amplitudonya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> sehingga amplitudonya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3.</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Karena <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>A</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> negatif, grafik dicerminkan terhadap sumbu <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>. Periodenya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mi>B</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> sehingga periodenya adalah</para>
<equation id="fs-id1177942" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mi>B</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </equation>

<para id="fs-id1340431">Grafik digeser ke kiri sebesar <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>C</m:mi>
   <m:mi>B</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> satuan. Lihat <link target-id="Figure_07_06_003" />.</para>

<figure id="Figure_07_06_003" class="small"><media id="fs-id1634678" alt="Grafik y=-3sin(2x+pi/2) dari -pi/4 hingga 3pi/2, yaitu satu siklus. Amplitudonya 3 dan periodenya pi.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_06_003.jpg" />
</media>
</figure></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> melibatkan kosinus, sehingga kita menggunakan bentuk
<equation id="fs-id1358303" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </equation><para id="fs-id2061888">Amplitudonya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="true">|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo stretchy="true">|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> sehingga amplitudonya 1. Periodenya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Lihat <link target-id="Figure_07_06_004" />. Ini adalah fungsi kosinus standar yang digeser ke atas tiga satuan.</para><figure id="Figure_07_06_004" class="small"><media id="fs-id1286075" alt="Grafik y=cos(x) + 3 dari -pi/2 hingga 5pi/2. Amplitudo dan periodenya sama dengan y=cos(x) biasa, tetapi seluruh grafik digeser ke atas sepanjang sumbu y sebesar 3.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_06_004.jpg" />
</media>
</figure></item>
</list></solution>
</exercise>
</example>

<note id="fs-id2020942" class="precalculus try"><label>Cobalah</label>
<exercise id="ti_07_06_01">
<problem id="fs-id1987679"><para id="fs-id2909339">Apa amplitudo dan periode fungsi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>?</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2286086"><para id="fs-id1177607">Amplitudonya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan periodenya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para></solution>
</exercise>
</note></section>

<section id="fs-id1333042"><title>Menentukan Persamaan dan Menggambar Grafik Fungsi Sinusoidal</title><para id="fs-id1415219">Salah satu cara menggambar fungsi sinusoidal adalah menentukan lima titik kunci. Titik-titik ini bersesuaian dengan interval-interval sama panjang yang masing-masing mewakili <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> periode. Titik-titik kunci menunjukkan letak nilai maksimum dan minimum. Jika tidak ada pergeseran vertikal, titik-titik tersebut juga menunjukkan titik potong sumbu <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>. Sebagai contoh, misalkan kita ingin menggambar fungsi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Kita mengetahui bahwa periodenya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> sehingga interval antartitik kunci ditentukan sebagai berikut.</para>
<equation id="fs-id2102442" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </equation>
<para id="fs-id2290195">Dimulai dari <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> kita menghitung nilai <emphasis effect="italics">y-</emphasis>pertama, menambahkan panjang interval <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> pada 0, lalu menghitung nilai <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis>kedua. Selanjutnya kita menambahkan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> berulang kali sampai kelima titik kunci ditentukan. Nilai terakhir harus sama dengan nilai pertama karena perhitungan mencakup satu periode penuh. Dengan membuat tabel seperti <link target-id="Table_07_07_01" />, kita dapat melihat titik-titik kunci ini dengan jelas pada grafik dalam <link target-id="Figure_07_07_002" />.</para><table id="Table_07_07_01" summary="Dua baris, enam kolom. Tabel memuat pasangan terurut berikut: (theta, y=cos(theta)), (0,1), (i/2, 0), (pi,-1), (3pi/2, 0), (2pi,1).">
<tgroup cols="6"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" align="center" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" align="center" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" align="center" />
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4" align="center" />
<colspec colnum="5" colname="c5" align="center" />
<colspec colnum="6" colname="c6" align="center" />
<tbody>
<row>
<entry align="center"><emphasis> <m:math>
 <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:math> </emphasis></entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mn>0</m:mn>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mi>π</m:mi>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
</row>

<row>
<entry align="center"><emphasis> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </emphasis></entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mn>0</m:mn>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>−1</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mn>0</m:mn>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:math>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>



</tgroup>
</table><figure id="Figure_07_07_002" class="small"><media id="fs-id2177508" alt="Grafik y=cos(x) dari -pi/2 hingga 5pi/2.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_07_002.jpg" />
</media>
</figure><example id="Example_07_06_03"><exercise id="fs-id2478628">
<problem id="fs-id1173784">
<title>Menggambar Grafik Fungsi Sinusoidal dengan Titik-Titik Kunci</title>
<para id="fs-id1506097">Gambarkan fungsi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−4</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> menggunakan amplitudo, periode, dan titik kunci.</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1372153">
<para id="fs-id1846805">Amplitudonya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mo stretchy="true">|</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="true">|</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4.</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
Periode adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2.</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> (Ingat bahwa kita kadang-kadang menyebut <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>B</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> sebagai <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>ω</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Satu siklus grafik dapat digambar pada interval <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Untuk menentukan titik-titik kunci, kita membagi periode dengan 4. Buatlah tabel seperti <link target-id="Table_07_07_02" />, dimulai dari <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> lalu tambahkan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> secara berturut-turut pada <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan hitung <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Lihat grafik di <link target-id="Figure_07_07_003" />.</para><table id="Table_07_07_02" summary="Dua baris, enam kolom. Tabel memuat pasangan terurut berikut: (theta, y=-4cos(pi*x)), (0,-4), (1/2, 0), (1,4), (3/2, 0), (2, -4).">
<tgroup cols="6"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" align="center" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" align="center" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" align="center" />
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4" align="center" />
<colspec colnum="5" colname="c5" align="center" />
<colspec colnum="6" colname="c6" align="center" />
<tbody>
<row>
<entry align="center"><emphasis> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </emphasis></entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mn>0</m:mn>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:math> </entry>
</row>

<row>
<entry align="center"><emphasis> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−4</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </emphasis></entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
<m:mn>−4</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mn>0</m:mn>
</m:math>
</entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
<m:mn>4</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mn>0</m:mn>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
<m:mn>−4</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
</row>
</tbody>


</tgroup>
</table><figure id="Figure_07_07_003" class="small"><media id="fs-id1743270" alt="Grafik y=-4cos(pi*x) dengan lima titik kunci, yaitu interval-interval sama panjang yang masing-masing mewakili 1/4 periode. Titik-titiknya berada pada 0, 1/2, 1, 3/2, dan 2.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_07_003.jpg" />
</media>
</figure></solution>
</exercise>
</example><note id="fs-id2571729" class="precalculus try">
<label>Cobalah</label>
<exercise id="ti_07_06_02"><problem id="fs-id2102282"><para id="fs-id1333064">Gambarkan fungsi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> menggunakan amplitudo, periode, dan lima titik kunci.</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2303325">

<table id="fs-id2353042" class="unnumbered" summary="Grafik y=3sin(3x) dengan lima titik kunci, yaitu interval-interval sama panjang yang masing-masing mewakili 1/4 periode. Titik-titiknya berada pada 0, pi/6, pi/3, pi/2, dan 2pi/3."><label />
<tgroup cols="2"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<thead>
<row>
<entry align="center">x</entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry align="center">0</entry>
<entry align="center">0</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>6</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</entry>
<entry align="center">3</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</entry>
<entry align="center">0</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>−3</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</entry>
<entry align="center">0</entry>
</row>
</tbody>

</tgroup>
</table><media id="fs-id2710496" alt="Grafik y=3sin(3x) dengan lima titik kunci, yaitu interval-interval sama panjang yang masing-masing mewakili 1/4 periode. Titik-titiknya berada pada 0, pi/6, pi/3, pi/2, dan 2pi/3. " display="block">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_07_004.jpg" />
</media>

</solution>
</exercise></note>

</section><section id="fs-id1223497">
  <title>Memodelkan Perilaku Periodik</title>
  <para id="fs-id1335579">Sekarang kita akan menerapkan gagasan-gagasan ini pada masalah yang melibatkan perilaku periodik.</para>

  <example id="Example_07_06_04"><exercise id="fs-id2462411">
    <problem id="fs-id1388678">
     <title>Memodelkan Persamaan dan Membuat Sketsa Grafik Sinusoidal yang Memenuhi Kriteria</title>
     <para id="fs-id1331394">Suhu rata-rata bulanan untuk sebuah kota kecil di Oregon diberikan dalam <link target-id="fs-id1336940" />. Tentukan fungsi sinusoidal berbentuk <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math> yang sesuai dengan data (bulatkan hingga sepersepuluh terdekat), lalu buat sketsa grafiknya.</para><table id="fs-id1336940" summary="Tiga belas baris, dua kolom. Tabel memuat pasangan terurut berikut: (Bulan, Suhu dalam derajat F), (Januari, 42.5), (Februari, 44.5), (Maret, 48.5), (April, 52.5), (Mei, 58), (Juni, 63), (Juli, 68.5), (Agustus, 69), (September, 64.5), (Oktober, 55.5), (November, 46.5), (Desember, 43.5).">
<tgroup cols="2"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" align="center" />
       <colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" align="center" />
       <thead>
        <row>
         <entry align="center">Bulan</entry>
         <entry align="center">Suhu, <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow />
   <m:mtext>o</m:mtext>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mtext>F</m:mtext>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>         </entry>
        </row>
       </thead>
       <tbody>
        <row>
         <entry align="center">Januari</entry>
         <entry align="center">42.5</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
         <entry align="center">Februari</entry>
         <entry align="center">44.5</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
         <entry align="center">Maret</entry>
         <entry align="center">48.5</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
         <entry align="center">April</entry>
         <entry align="center">52.5</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
         <entry align="center">Mei</entry>
         <entry align="center">58</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
         <entry align="center">Juni</entry>
         <entry align="center">63</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
         <entry align="center">Juli</entry>
         <entry align="center">68.5</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
         <entry align="center">Agustus</entry>
         <entry align="center">69</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
         <entry align="center">September</entry>
         <entry align="center">64.5</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
         <entry align="center">Oktober</entry>
         <entry align="center">55.5</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
         <entry align="center">November</entry>
         <entry align="center">46.5</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
         <entry align="center">Desember</entry>
         <entry align="center">43.5</entry>
        </row>
       </tbody>

</tgroup>
</table></problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1875851">

    <para id="fs-id2031063">Ingat bahwa amplitudo ditentukan dengan rumus</para>
     <equation id="fs-id1161629" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mtext>nilai terbesar </m:mtext><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mtext>nilai terkecil</m:mtext>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>

      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </equation>
    <para id="fs-id968691">Dengan demikian, amplitudo adalah</para>
     <equation id="fs-id1333359" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>|</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mo>|</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>69</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>42.5</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>    </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>13.25</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id2793443">Data mencakup periode 12 bulan, sehingga <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mi>B</m:mi>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math> yang memberikan <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>12</m:mn>
        </m:mrow>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        <m:mn>6</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mo>.</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para><para id="fs-id1362205">Pergeseran vertikal ditentukan dengan persamaan berikut.</para>
     <equation id="fs-id2084680" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mtext>nilai tertinggi</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mtext>nilai terendah</m:mtext>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>

      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </equation>
    <para id="fs-id1369261"><newline count="2" />Dengan demikian, pergeseran vertikal adalah</para>
<equation id="fs-id2467697" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mtable columnalign="left">
  <m:mtr>
   <m:mtd>
    <m:mtable columnalign="left">
     <m:mtr columnalign="left">
      <m:mtd columnalign="left">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>69</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>42.5</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mtd>
     </m:mtr>
     <m:mtr columnalign="left">
      <m:mtd columnalign="left">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mtext>   </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>55.8</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mtd>
     </m:mtr>

    </m:mtable>
   </m:mtd>
  </m:mtr>
 </m:mtable>

</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1128874">Sejauh ini, kita memperoleh persamaan <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>13.3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>6</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>55.8.</m:mn>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>

<para id="fs-id2160567">Untuk menentukan pergeseran horizontal, kita substitusikan nilai <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math> dan <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>y</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math> untuk bulan pertama, lalu selesaikan untuk <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>C</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
     <equation id="fs-id1295023" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>   </m:mtext><m:mn>42.5</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>13.3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>6</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>55.8</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>13.3</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>13.3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>6</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>    </m:mtext><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>6</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">→</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>6</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>6</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>          </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1782945">Kita memperoleh persamaan <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>13.3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>6</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>

        </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>55.8.</m:mn>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math> Lihat grafik di <link target-id="Figure_07_06_011" />.</para>

<figure id="Figure_07_06_011" class="small"><media id="fs-id2175688" alt="Grafik persamaan y=13.3sin(pi/6 x - 2pi/3) + 55.8. Nilai rata-ratanya ditunjukkan oleh garis horizontal putus-putus y=55.8 dan amplitudonya 13.3.">
      <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_06_011.jpg" />
     </media>
    </figure></solution>
   </exercise>
  </example><example id="Example_07_06_06"><exercise id="fs-id1345601">
    <problem id="fs-id2723419">
     <title>Mendeskripsikan Gerak Periodik</title>
     <para id="fs-id2773835">Jarum penunjuk jam pada jam besar di dinding Union Station panjangnya 24 inci. Pada tengah hari, ujung jarum tersebut berjarak 30 inci dari langit-langit. Pada pukul 15.00, ujungnya berjarak 54 inci dari langit-langit, dan pada pukul 18.00 berjarak 78 inci. Pada pukul 21.00 jaraknya kembali 54 inci; pada tengah malam, ujung jarum kembali ke posisi awalnya, 30 inci dari langit-langit. Misalkan <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>y</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math> sama dengan jarak dari ujung jarum penunjuk jam ke langit-langit <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math> jam setelah tengah hari. Tentukan persamaan yang memodelkan gerak jarum jam dan buat sketsa grafiknya.</para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1328303">


    <para id="fs-id1213671">Mulailah dengan membuat tabel nilai seperti pada <link target-id="fs-id1992294" />.</para><table id="fs-id1992294" summary="Enam baris, tiga kolom. Tabel memuat pasangan terurut berikut: (X, y, Titik yang diplot), (Tengah hari, 30 inci, (0,30)), (Pukul 15.00, 54 inci, (3,54)), (Pukul 18.00, 78 inci, (6,8)), (Pukul 21.00, 54 inci, (9,54)), (Tengah malam, 30 inci, (12,30)).">
<tgroup cols="3"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" align="center" />
       <colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" align="center" />
       <colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" align="center" />
       <thead>
        <row>
         <entry align="center"> <m:math>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
         </m:math>
         </entry>
         <entry align="center"> <m:math>
          <m:mi>y</m:mi>
         </m:math>
         </entry>
         <entry align="center">Titik yang diplot</entry>
        </row>
       </thead>
       <tbody>
        <row>
         <entry align="center">Tengah hari</entry>
         <entry align="center">30 inci</entry>
         <entry align="center"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>30</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
          </m:mrow>
         </m:math>
         </entry>
        </row>
        <row>
         <entry align="center">Pukul 15.00</entry>
         <entry align="center">54 inci</entry>
         <entry align="center"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>54</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
          </m:mrow>
         </m:math>
         </entry>
        </row>
        <row>
         <entry align="center">Pukul 18.00</entry>
         <entry align="center">78 inci</entry>
         <entry align="center"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>78</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
          </m:mrow>
         </m:math>
         </entry>
        </row>
        <row>
         <entry align="center">Pukul 21.00</entry>
         <entry align="center">54 inci</entry>
         <entry align="center"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>54</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
          </m:mrow>
         </m:math>
         </entry>
        </row>
        <row>
         <entry align="center">Tengah malam</entry>
         <entry align="center">30 inci</entry>
         <entry align="center"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>30</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
          </m:mrow>
         </m:math>
         </entry>
        </row>
       </tbody>

</tgroup>
</table><para id="fs-id697250">Untuk memodelkan persamaan, terlebih dahulu kita menentukan amplitudonya.</para>
     <equation id="fs-id1247000" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtable columnalign="left">
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="true">|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo stretchy="true">|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="true">|</m:mo> <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mn>78</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>30</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow> <m:mo stretchy="true">|</m:mo></m:mrow>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mtext>    </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id1847251">Siklus jam berulang setiap 12 jam. Dengan demikian,</para>
     <equation id="fs-id1971097" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
 <m:mtable columnalign="left">
  <m:mtr>
   <m:mtd>
    <m:mrow />
   </m:mtd>
  </m:mtr>
  <m:mtr>
   <m:mtd>
    <m:mtable columnalign="left">
     <m:mtr columnalign="left">
      <m:mtd columnalign="left">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>12</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mtd>
     </m:mtr>
     <m:mtr columnalign="left">
      <m:mtd columnalign="left">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mtext>   </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>6</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mtd>
     </m:mtr>

    </m:mtable>
   </m:mtd>
  </m:mtr>
 </m:mtable>

</m:math>
</equation>
<para id="fs-id2131557">Pergeseran vertikal adalah</para>
     <equation id="fs-id1612211" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
 <m:mtable columnalign="left">
  <m:mtr>
   <m:mtd>
    <m:mrow />
   </m:mtd>
  </m:mtr>
  <m:mtr>
   <m:mtd>
    <m:mtable columnalign="left">
     <m:mtr columnalign="left">
      <m:mtd columnalign="left">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>78</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>30</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mtd>
     </m:mtr>
     <m:mtr columnalign="left">
      <m:mtd columnalign="left">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mtext>   </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>54</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mtd>
     </m:mtr>

    </m:mtable>
   </m:mtd>
  </m:mtr>
 </m:mtable>

</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id2102415">Tidak ada pergeseran horizontal, jadi <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>C</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.</m:mn>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math> Karena fungsi bermula pada nilai minimum <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>y</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math> saat <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math> (bukan nilai maksimum), kita menggunakan fungsi kosinus dengan nilai negatif untuk <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math> Dalam bentuk <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math> persamaannya adalah</para>

<equation id="fs-id1340988" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−24</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>6</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>54</m:mn>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </equation><para id="fs-id1556363">Lihat <link target-id="Figure_07_06_013" />.</para>

    <figure id="Figure_07_06_013" class="small"><media id="fs-id2035235" alt="Grafik fungsi y=-24cos(pi/6 x)+54 dengan lima titik kunci: (0,30), (3,54), (6,78), (9,54), (12,30).">
      <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_06_013.jpg" />
     </media>
    </figure></solution>
   </exercise>
  </example><example id="Example_07_06_07">
   <exercise id="fs-id2209186">
    <problem id="fs-id1877849">
     <title>Menentukan Model Pasang Surut</title>
     <para id="fs-id1099909">Ketinggian pasang surut di sebuah kota pantai kecil diukur sepanjang tembok laut. Tinggi air berosilasi antara 7 kaki saat surut dan 15 kaki saat pasang. Pada suatu hari, air surut terjadi pukul 06.00 dan air pasang terjadi pada tengah hari. Siklus tersebut berulang kira-kira setiap 12 jam. Tentukan persamaan yang memodelkan tinggi air.</para>

    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1367707">


    <para id="fs-id1961795">Karena tinggi air bervariasi dari 7 kaki hingga 15 kaki, amplitudonya dapat dihitung sebagai</para>
     <equation id="fs-id1151331" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtable columnalign="left">
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>|</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mo>|</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mrow>
           <m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mtext>    </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<para id="fs-id1981423">Siklus ini diulang setiap 12 jam; oleh karena itu, <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>B</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math> adalah</para>
     <equation id="fs-id1688189" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>12</m:mn>
        </m:mrow>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        <m:mn>6</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>

      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </equation>
     <para id="fs-id1853601">Terdapat pergeseran vertikal sebesar <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>11.</m:mn>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math> Karena nilai fungsi mencapai maksimum pada <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math> Kita akan menggunakan fungsi kosinus, dengan nilai positif untuk <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
      </para><equation id="fs-id1692290" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>6</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>

        </m:mrow>
        <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </equation><para id="fs-id1698026">Lihat <link target-id="Figure_07_06_015" />.</para>

    <figure id="Figure_07_06_015" class="small"><media id="fs-id1343710" alt="Grafik fungsi y=4cos(pi/6 t) + 11 dari 0 hingga 12. Garis tengahnya y=11; tiga titik kuncinya adalah (0,15), (6,7), dan (12,15).">
      <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_06_015.jpg" />
     </media>
    </figure></solution>
   </exercise>
  </example>

  <note id="fs-id1248789" class="precalculus try">
   <label>Cobalah</label>
   <exercise id="ti_07_06_03"><problem id="fs-id1522753"><para id="fs-id1522754">Suhu harian pada bulan Maret di suatu kota bervariasi dari nilai terendah <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>24</m:mn><m:mtext>  °F</m:mtext>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:math> hingga nilai tertinggi <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>40</m:mn><m:mtext>  °F</m:mtext><m:mtext>.</m:mtext>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:math> Tentukan fungsi sinusoidal yang memodelkan suhu harian dan buat sketsa grafiknya. Perkirakan saat suhu mencapai titik beku <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>32</m:mn><m:mtext>  °F</m:mtext><m:mtext>.</m:mtext>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:math> Misalkan <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:math> bersesuaian dengan tengah hari.</para></problem>
    <solution id="fs-id2020742">
     <para id="fs-id1893405"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mn>12</m:mn>
          </m:mrow>
         </m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>t</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>32</m:mn>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
      <newline />
   Suhu mencapai titik beku pada tengah hari dan tengah malam.</para>
  <media id="fs-id2322911" alt="Grafik fungsi y=8sin(pi/12 t) + 32 untuk suhu. Garis tengahnya 32. Suhu bernilai 32 pada tengah malam dan tengah hari.">
       <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_06_016.jpg" />
      </media></solution></exercise></note>

  <example id="Example_07_06_08">
   <exercise id="fs-id2052518"><problem id="fs-id2251185">
     <title>Menafsirkan Persamaan Perilaku Periodik</title>
     <para id="fs-id1956234">Tekanan darah rata-rata seseorang dimodelkan oleh fungsi <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>t</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>160</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>100</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math> di mana <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>t</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math> menyatakan tekanan darah pada waktu <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
      yang diukur dalam menit. Tafsirkan fungsi tersebut berdasarkan periode dan frekuensi. Buat sketsa grafiknya dan tentukan pembacaan tekanan darah.</para></problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1113490">


    <para id="fs-id2339667">Periode tersebut diberikan oleh</para>
     <equation id="fs-id1722880" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mtable columnalign="left">

  <m:mtr>
   <m:mtd>
    <m:mtable columnalign="left">
     <m:mtr columnalign="left">
      <m:mtd columnalign="left">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>160</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mtd>
     </m:mtr>
     <m:mtr columnalign="left">
      <m:mtd columnalign="left">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mtext>     </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>80</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mtd>
     </m:mtr>

    </m:mtable>
   </m:mtd>
  </m:mtr>
 </m:mtable>

</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id2172922">Dalam fungsi tekanan darah, frekuensi menyatakan jumlah denyut jantung per menit. Frekuensi adalah resiprokal dari periode dan diberikan oleh</para>
     <equation id="fs-id1478155" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
      <m:mtable>
       <m:mtr>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
         </m:mfrac>
         <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mn>160</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
         </m:mfrac>

        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>
       <m:mtr>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>80</m:mn>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>
      </m:mtable>

     </m:math>
     </equation>
    <para id="fs-id2296975">Lihat grafik di <link target-id="Figure_07_06_017" />.</para>

    <figure id="Figure_07_06_017" class="small"><media id="fs-id1760753" alt="Grafik fungsi f(t) = 20sin(160 * pi * t) + 100 untuk tekanan darah. Garis tengahnya berada pada 100.">
      <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_06_017.jpg" />
     </media>

    <caption>Pembacaan tekanan darah pada grafik adalah <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>120</m:mn>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>80</m:mn>
        </m:mrow>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mfrac>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mtext>maksimum</m:mtext>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mtext>minimum</m:mtext>
          </m:mrow>
         </m:mfrac>

        </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </caption></figure></solution>
    <commentary id="fs-id1936106">
     <title>Analisis </title>


     <para id="fs-id1535704">Tekanan darah <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>120</m:mn>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>80</m:mn>
        </m:mrow>
       </m:mfrac>

      </m:mrow>
     </m:math> dianggap normal. Angka atas adalah nilai maksimum atau sistolik, yang mengukur tekanan dalam arteri ketika jantung berkontraksi. Angka bawah adalah nilai minimum atau diastolik, yang mengukur tekanan dalam arteri ketika jantung berelaksasi di antara denyut dan kembali terisi darah. Dengan demikian, tekanan darah normal dapat dimodelkan oleh fungsi periodik dengan maksimum 120 dan minimum 80.</para>
    </commentary>
   </exercise></example>

 </section>




<section id="fs-id1146451">
<title>Memodelkan Fungsi Gerak Harmonik</title>
<para id="fs-id1782792">Gerak harmonik merupakan salah satu bentuk gerak periodik, tetapi terdapat faktor-faktor yang membedakan keduanya. Sistem yang menunjukkan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00006">gerak periodik</term> biasa menjalani setiap siklus tanpa gangguan dari luar, sedangkan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00007">gerak harmonik</term> memerlukan gaya pemulih. Contoh gerak harmonik antara lain gerak pegas, gaya gravitasi, dan gaya magnetik.</para>

<section id="fs-id1227506">
<title>Gerak Harmonik Sederhana</title>
 <para id="fs-id3038708">Jenis gerak yang disebut <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00008">gerak harmonik sederhana</term> melibatkan gaya pemulih tetapi mengasumsikan bahwa gerak akan berlanjut selamanya. Bayangkan sebuah benda berbobot yang tergantung pada pegas. Ketika tidak diganggu, benda tersebut dikatakan diam atau berada dalam keseimbangan. Jika benda ditarik ke bawah lalu dilepaskan, gaya pegas menariknya kembali menuju keseimbangan dan gerak harmonik pun dimulai. Gaya pemulih berbanding lurus dengan simpangan benda dari titik keseimbangannya. Ketika <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>d</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </para>

<note id="fs-id1167808">

<title>Gerak Harmonik Sederhana</title>
<para id="fs-id2248340">Kita melihat bahwa persamaan <term id="term-00009">gerak harmonik sederhana</term> diberikan dalam bentuk simpangan:</para>
 <equation id="Equation_07_06_02" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>d</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>ω</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mtext>  atau  </m:mtext><m:mi>d</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>ω</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </equation><para id="fs-id1480838">di mana <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>a</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> adalah amplitudo, <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mfrac>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
   </m:mfrac>

  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> adalah periode, dan <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
   </m:mfrac>

  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> adalah frekuensi, yaitu jumlah siklus per satuan waktu.</para>
</note>

<example id="Example_07_06_09">
<exercise id="fs-id2867398">
<problem id="fs-id2867400">
<title>Menentukan Simpangan, Periode, dan Frekuensi serta Menggambar Grafik Fungsi</title>
<para id="fs-id2614724">Untuk fungsi yang diberikan,</para>
<list id="fs-id2614727" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic">
 <item>Tentukan simpangan maksimum benda.</item>
<item>Tentukan periode, yaitu waktu yang diperlukan untuk satu getaran.</item>
<item>Tentukan frekuensinya.</item>
<item>Buat sketsa grafiknya.</item></list>
<list id="fs-id1611913" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </item>
 <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </item>
 <item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>π</m:mi>
      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
     </m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </item></list>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1805776">

<list id="fs-id1378735" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>

<list id="fs-id1961806" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic"><item>Simpangan maksimum sama dengan amplitudo, <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="true">|</m:mo> <m:mi>a</m:mi> <m:mo stretchy="true">|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> yaitu 5.</item>
 <item>Periode adalah <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mfrac>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mn>3</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>.</m:mo>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </item>
 <item>Frekuensi diberikan sebagai <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mn>3</m:mn>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>.</m:mo>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </item>
<item>Lihat <link target-id="Figure_07_07_006" />. Grafik menunjukkan lima titik kunci.

<figure id="Figure_07_07_006" class="small"><media id="fs-id1910295" alt="Grafik fungsi y=5sin(3t) dari 0 hingga 2pi/3. Lima titik kuncinya adalah (0,0), (pi/6,5), (pi/3,0), (pi/2,-5), (2pi/3,0). ">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_07_006.jpg" />
</media>
</figure>
</item></list></item>
 <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span>
 <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:math>

<list id="fs-id1240167" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic"><item>Simpangan maksimumnya adalah <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mn>6.</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </item>
 <item>Periode adalah <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mfrac>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2.</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </item>
 <item>Frekuensi adalah <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mn>1</m:mn>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>.</m:mo>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </item>
<item>Lihat <link target-id="Figure_07_07_007" />.

<figure id="Figure_07_07_007" class="small"><media id="fs-id2242237" alt="Grafik fungsi y=6cos(pi t) dari 0 hingga 3.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_07_007.jpg" />
</media>
</figure></item>
</list></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span>
 <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>π</m:mi>
      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
     </m:mfrac>

    </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>

<list id="fs-id1793844" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic"><item>Simpangan maksimumnya adalah <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mn>5.</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </item>
 <item>Periode adalah <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mfrac>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>π</m:mi>
      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
     </m:mfrac>

    </m:mrow>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4.</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </item>
 <item>Frekuensi adalah <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mfrac>
    <m:mn>1</m:mn>
    <m:mn>4</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>.</m:mo>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </item>
<item>Lihat <link target-id="Figure_07_07_008" />.

 <figure id="Figure_07_07_008" class="small"><media id="fs-id1968516" alt="Grafik fungsi y=5cos(pi/2 t) dari 0 hingga 4.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_07_008.jpg" />
</media>
 </figure></item>
</list></item>
</list></solution>
</exercise>
</example>

</section>
<section id="fs-id1178609">
<title>Gerak Harmonik Teredam</title>
<para id="fs-id2208302">Pada kenyataannya, bandul tidak berayun bolak-balik selamanya dan benda pada pegas tidak bergerak naik-turun selamanya. Pada akhirnya, bandul berhenti berayun, benda berhenti bergerak, dan keduanya kembali ke keseimbangan. Gerak periodik yang dipengaruhi gaya yang mendisipasikan energi, atau faktor redaman, dikenal sebagai <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00010">gerak harmonik teredam</term>. Gesekan biasanya merupakan faktor redaman.</para>
<para id="fs-id1363985">Dalam fisika, berbagai rumus digunakan untuk memperhitungkan faktor redaman pada benda bergerak. Sebagian di antaranya merupakan rumus berbasis kalkulus yang melibatkan turunan. Untuk keperluan ini, kita akan menggunakan rumus untuk model dasar gerak harmonik teredam.</para>

<note id="fs-id1945862">

<title>Gerak Harmonik Teredam </title>
<para id="fs-id2600645">Dalam <term id="term-00011">gerak harmonik teredam</term>, simpangan benda yang berosilasi dari posisi diamnya pada waktu <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>t</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> diberikan oleh</para>
<equation id="Equation_07_06_03" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:msup>
   <m:mi>e</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>ω</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mtext>atau</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:msup>
   <m:mi>e</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>ω</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id1816007">di mana <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>c</m:mi>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> adalah faktor redaman, <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="true">|</m:mo> <m:mi>a</m:mi> <m:mo stretchy="true">|</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> adalah simpangan awal, dan <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mfrac>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
   </m:mfrac>

  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> adalah periode.</para></note>

<example id="Example_07_06_10">
<exercise id="fs-id2613612">
<problem id="fs-id2613615">
<title>Memodelkan Gerak Harmonik Teredam</title>
 <para id="fs-id2180761">Modelkan persamaan yang sesuai dengan dua situasi berikut dan gunakan perangkat grafik untuk menggambar fungsi-fungsinya: Dua sistem massa-pegas mengalami gerak harmonik teredam dengan frekuensi <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mn>0.5</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> siklus per detik. Keduanya memiliki simpangan awal 10 cm. Sistem pertama memiliki faktor redaman <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mn>0.5</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> dan sistem kedua memiliki faktor redaman <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mn>0.1.</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1483243">


 <para id="fs-id1483245">Pada waktu <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> simpangannya mencapai maksimum 10 cm, sehingga diperlukan fungsi kosinus. Fungsi kosinus berlaku untuk kedua model.</para><para id="fs-id1237400">Kita diberi frekuensi <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
   </m:mfrac>

  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> sebesar 0,5 siklus per detik. Dengan demikian,</para>
 <equation id="fs-id2268331" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>  </m:mtext><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>    </m:mtext><m:mi>ω</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>       </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id3483104">Sistem pegas pertama memiliki faktor redaman <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.5.</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> Dengan mengikuti model umum gerak harmonik teredam, kita memperoleh</para>
<equation id="fs-id1478101" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mi>t</m:mi>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup>
     <m:mi>e</m:mi>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn><m:mi>t</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:msup>
   <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </equation>
<para id="fs-id1743104"><link target-id="Figure_07_07_009" /> memodelkan gerak sistem pegas pertama.</para>

<figure id="Figure_07_07_009" class="small"><media id="fs-id1693953" alt="Grafik sistem pegas pertama, f(t) = 10(e^(-.5t))cos(pi*t), yang bermula dengan amplitudo besar lalu cepat menurun.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_07_009.jpg" />
</media>
</figure><para id="fs-id1406939">Sistem pegas kedua memiliki faktor redaman <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.1</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> dan dapat dimodelkan sebagai</para>
 <equation id="fs-id2243606" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mi>t</m:mi>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup>
     <m:mi>e</m:mi>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.1</m:mn><m:mi>t</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:msup>
   <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </equation>
<para id="fs-id2244434"><link target-id="Figure_07_07_010" /> memodelkan gerak sistem pegas kedua.</para>

<figure id="Figure_07_07_010" class="small"><media id="fs-id1880700" alt="Grafik f(t) = 10(e^(-.1t))cos(pi*t), yang bermula dengan amplitudo besar lalu menurun perlahan (tetapi memiliki frekuensi tinggi).">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_07_010.jpg" />
</media>
</figure></solution>
<commentary id="fs-id697870">
<title>Analisis </title>

 <para id="fs-id2591005">Perhatikan perbedaan pengaruh konstanta redaman. Nilai maksimum dan minimum lokal fungsi dengan faktor redaman <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> menurun jauh lebih cepat daripada fungsi dengan <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.1.</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </para>


 </commentary>
</exercise>
</example>

<example id="Example_07_06_11">
<exercise id="fs-id2048238">
<problem id="fs-id2048240">
<title>Menentukan Fungsi Kosinus yang Memodelkan Gerak Harmonik Teredam</title>
 <para id="fs-id2132461">Tentukan dan gambarkan fungsi berbentuk <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:msup>
    <m:mi>e</m:mi>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
   </m:msup>
   <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>ω</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> yang memodelkan informasi yang diberikan.</para>
<list id="fs-id1856582" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.05</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>p</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </item>
 <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1.5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </item>
</list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1262498">


 <para id="fs-id1262500">Substitusikan nilai-nilai yang diberikan ke dalam model. Ingat bahwa periodenya adalah <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mfrac>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
   </m:mfrac>

  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> dan frekuensinya adalah <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>.</m:mo>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </para>
 <list id="fs-id2690189" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:msup>
    <m:mi>e</m:mi>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.05</m:mn><m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
   </m:msup>
   <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>π</m:mi>
      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
     </m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> Lihat <link target-id="Figure_07_07_011" />.

<figure id="Figure_07_07_011" class="small"><media id="fs-id1817246" alt="Grafik f(t) = 20(e^(-.05t))cos(pi/2 * t), yang bermula dengan amplitudo besar lalu menurun perlahan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_07_011.jpg" />
</media>
</figure></item>

  <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup>
     <m:mi>e</m:mi>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1.5</m:mn><m:mi>t</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:math> Lihat <link target-id="Figure_07_07_012" />.

<figure id="Figure_07_07_012" class="small"><media id="fs-id2465127" alt="Grafik f(t) = 2(e^(-1.5t))cos(6pi * t), yang bermula dengan amplitudo kecil lalu cepat menurun hingga hampir berupa garis lurus.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_07_012.jpg" />
</media>
</figure></item></list></solution>
 </exercise>
</example>


<note id="fs-id1646584" class="precalculus try">
<label>Cobalah</label>
<exercise id="ti_07_06_04">
 <problem id="fs-id1568046"><para id="fs-id2045288">Persamaan berikut menyatakan model gerak harmonik teredam: <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mi>t</m:mi>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup>
     <m:mi>e</m:mi>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>t</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:msup>
   <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
  Tentukan simpangan awal, konstanta redaman, dan frekuensinya.</para></problem>
 <solution id="fs-id1327987"><para id="fs-id1327988">simpangan awal = 6, konstanta redaman = -6, frekuensi = <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mfrac>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mfrac>

  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
  </para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="Example_07_06_12">
 <exercise id="fs-id2252291">
 <problem id="fs-id2252293">

<title>Menentukan Fungsi Sinus yang Memodelkan Gerak Harmonik Teredam
</title><para id="fs-id2138578">Tentukan dan gambarkan fungsi berbentuk <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:msup>
   <m:mi>e</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>ω</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> yang memodelkan informasi yang diberikan.</para>
<list id="fs-id2065915" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled">
 <item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>p</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
    <m:mn>6</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>

  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </item>
 <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>20</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </item>
</list>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2012720">
 <para id="fs-id2880325">Hitung nilai <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> dan substitusikan nilai-nilai yang diketahui ke dalam model.</para>
<list id="fs-id1341299" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled">
<item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Karena periodenya adalah <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mfrac>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>,</m:mo>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> kita memperoleh
  <equation id="fs-id2613545" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>   </m:mtext><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>6</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>ω</m:mi><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>   </m:mtext><m:mi>ω</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id2638895">Faktor redamannya 10 dan amplitudonya 7. Dengan demikian, modelnya adalah <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:msup>
     <m:mi>e</m:mi>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>t</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>t</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:math> Lihat <link target-id="Figure_07_07_013" />.</para>

<figure id="Figure_07_07_013" class="small"><media id="fs-id2757480" alt="Grafik f(t) = 7(e^(-10t))sin(12t), yang memuncak di dekat t=0 lalu cepat menjadi hampir berupa garis lurus.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_07_013.jpg" />
</media>
</figure></item>
  <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Karena frekuensinya adalah <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mo>,</m:mo>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:math> kita memperoleh
   <equation id="fs-id1916919" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>  </m:mtext><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>40</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>ω</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id2887261">Faktor redamannya adalah <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>0.2</m:mn>    </m:mrow>
   </m:math> dan amplitudo adalah <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>0.3.</m:mn>    </m:mrow>
   </m:math> Modelnya adalah <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.3</m:mn><m:msup>
      <m:mi>e</m:mi>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.2</m:mn><m:mi>t</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:msup>
     <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mn>40</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>    </m:mrow>
   </m:math> Lihat <link target-id="Figure_07_07_014" />.</para>

<figure id="Figure_07_07_014" class="small"><media id="fs-id1506062" alt="Grafik f(t) = .3e^(-.2t)sin(40pi*t), yang beramplitudo kecil tetapi cepat menyusut hingga tampak seperti garis lurus. Frekuensinya begitu tinggi sehingga pada skala ini fungsi tampak seperti bidang padat. Cuplikan grafik yang diperbesar menunjukkan bentuk sinusoidal fungsi yang sebenarnya.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_07_014.jpg" />
</media>
</figure></item></list></solution>
<commentary id="fs-id1980962">
<title>Analisis </title>


 <para id="fs-id1952696">Perbandingan dua contoh terakhir menunjukkan cara memilih fungsi sinus atau kosinus untuk memodelkan kriteria sinusoidal. Kita melihat bahwa fungsi kosinus berada pada simpangan maksimum ketika <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> sedangkan fungsi sinus berada di titik keseimbangan ketika <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> Sebagai contoh, perhatikan persamaan <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:msup>
    <m:mi>e</m:mi>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.05</m:mn><m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
   </m:msup>
   <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>π</m:mi>
      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
     </m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> dari <link target-id="Example_07_06_11" />. Dari grafik terlihat bahwa ketika <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>, </m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> yang merupakan amplitudo awal. Periksa hal ini dengan menetapkan <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> dalam persamaan kosinus:</para>

<equation id="fs-id697726" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mtable columnalign="left">
  <m:mtr>
   <m:mtd>
    <m:mrow />
   </m:mtd>
  </m:mtr>
  <m:mtr>
   <m:mtd>
    <m:mtable columnalign="left">
     <m:mtr columnalign="left">
      <m:mtd columnalign="left">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:msup>
         <m:mi>e</m:mi>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.05</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>π</m:mi>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mtd>
     </m:mtr>
     <m:mtr columnalign="left">
      <m:mtd columnalign="left">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mtd>
     </m:mtr>
     <m:mtr columnalign="left">
      <m:mtd columnalign="left">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>20</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mtd>
     </m:mtr>

    </m:mtable>
   </m:mtd>
  </m:mtr>
 </m:mtable>

</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id1877994">Menggunakan fungsi sinus menghasilkan</para>
 <equation id="fs-id1877997" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:msup>
       <m:mi>e</m:mi>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.05</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id2831176">Dengan demikian, kosinus adalah fungsi yang tepat.</para>
</commentary>
</exercise>
</example>

<note id="fs-id1772090" class="precalculus try">
<label>Cobalah</label>
<exercise id="ti_07_06_05">
 <problem id="fs-id2724074"><para id="fs-id2724075">Tuliskan persamaan gerak harmonik teredam jika diketahui <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> dan <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>p</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2.</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </para></problem>
 <solution id="fs-id1920358"><para id="fs-id2130331"> <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup>
    <m:mi>e</m:mi>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn><m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
   </m:msup>
   <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>

<example id="Example_07_06_13">
<exercise id="fs-id1582334">
 <problem id="fs-id1582336"><title>Memodelkan Osilasi Pegas</title>

  <para id="fs-id1871477">Sebuah pegas yang panjang alaminya 10 inci dimampatkan sejauh 5 inci lalu dilepaskan. Pegas berosilasi sekali setiap 3 detik dan amplitudonya berkurang 30% setiap detik. Tentukan persamaan yang memodelkan posisi pegas <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>t</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:math> detik setelah dilepaskan.</para>

</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2205593">


<para id="fs-id2205595">Amplitudo awalnya 5 inci dan berkurang 30% setiap detik. Karena pegas mula-mula dimampatkan, kita menuliskan <emphasis effect="italics">A</emphasis> sebagai nilai negatif. Bagian amplitudo fungsi dapat ditulis sebagai</para>
 <equation id="fs-id1404933" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mi>t</m:mi>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.30</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:msup>

  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </equation>
 <para id="fs-id1649436">Kita menuliskan <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:msup>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.30</m:mn>
      </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mi>t</m:mi>
   </m:msup>

  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> dalam bentuk <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:msup>
    <m:mi>e</m:mi>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
   </m:msup>

  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> sebagai berikut:</para>
 <equation id="fs-id1697196" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>0.7</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mi>e</m:mi>
       <m:mi>c</m:mi>
      </m:msup>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>   </m:mtext><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>ln</m:mi><m:mn>.7</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>   </m:mtext><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.357</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<para id="fs-id1910239">Sekarang perhatikan periodenya. Pegas menjalani satu siklus posisi setiap 3 detik; inilah periodenya, dan kita dapat menggunakan rumus untuk menentukan omega.</para>
 <equation id="fs-id1407962" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mi>ω</m:mi>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>ω</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id2732662">Panjang alami 10 inci merupakan garis tengah. Kita menggunakan fungsi kosinus karena pegas bermula pada simpangan maksimumnya. Bagian persamaan ini dinyatakan sebagai</para>
 <equation id="fs-id1602451" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mfrac>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
      <m:mn>3</m:mn>
     </m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </equation>
 <para id="fs-id2079792">Terakhir, kita gabungkan kedua fungsi. Model posisi pegas pada waktu <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>t</m:mi>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> detik diberikan oleh</para>
 <equation id="fs-id2595612" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup>
    <m:mi>e</m:mi>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.357</m:mn><m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
   </m:msup>
   <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mfrac>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
      <m:mn>3</m:mn>
     </m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </equation>
<para id="fs-id1218295">Lihat grafik di <link target-id="Figure_07_06_018" />.</para>

<figure id="Figure_07_06_018" class="small"><media id="fs-id2301076" alt="Grafik fungsi y = -5e^(-.35t)cos(2pi/3 t) + 10 dari 0 hingga 24. Grafik bermula sebagai gelombang beramplitudo besar lalu dengan sangat cepat menyusut hingga hampir berupa garis lurus.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_06_018.jpg" />
</media>
</figure></solution>
</exercise>
</example>

<note id="fs-id2028355" class="precalculus try">
<label>Cobalah</label>
<exercise id="ti_07_06_06">
 <problem id="fs-id2017065"><para id="fs-id1267417">Sebuah massa yang tergantung pada pegas dinaikkan 5 cm di atas posisi diamnya. Massa dilepaskan pada waktu <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> dan dibiarkan berosilasi. Setelah <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mfrac>
    <m:mn>1</m:mn>
    <m:mn>3</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>

  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> detik, diamati bahwa massa kembali ke posisi tertingginya. Tentukan fungsi yang memodelkan gerak ini relatif terhadap posisi diam awalnya.</para></problem>
 <solution id="fs-id2281162"><para id="fs-id2281163"> <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>

<example id="Example_07_06_14">
<exercise id="fs-id1611754"><problem id="fs-id1611756">
 <title>Menentukan Nilai Konstanta Redaman <emphasis effect="italics">c</emphasis> Berdasarkan Kriteria yang Diberikan</title>
<para id="fs-id1374704">Senar gitar dipetik dan bergetar dalam gerak harmonik teredam. Senar ditarik hingga menyimpang 2 cm dari posisi diamnya. Setelah 3 detik, simpangan senar terukur 1 cm. Tentukan konstanta redamannya.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1664892">


 <para id="fs-id1664894">Faktor simpangan menyatakan amplitudo dan ditentukan oleh koefisien <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>a</m:mi><m:msup>
    <m:mi>e</m:mi>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
   </m:msup>

  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> dalam model gerak harmonik teredam. Konstanta redaman terdapat dalam suku <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:msup>
    <m:mi>e</m:mi>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
   </m:msup>
   <m:mo>.</m:mo>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> Diketahui bahwa setelah 3 detik, maksimum lokal bernilai setengah dari nilai awalnya. Oleh karena itu, kita memperoleh persamaan</para>
 <equation id="fs-id1863048" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>a</m:mi><m:msup>
   <m:mi>e</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:msup>
   <m:mi>e</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id2115300">Gunakan aljabar dan sifat-sifat eksponen untuk menyelesaikan terhadap <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </para>
 <equation id="fs-id1743219" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>a</m:mi><m:msup>
       <m:mi>e</m:mi>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>a</m:mi><m:msup>
       <m:mi>e</m:mi>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msup>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mi>e</m:mi>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>⋅</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mi>e</m:mi>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>c</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mi>e</m:mi>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mtable>
       <m:mtr>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>Bagi dengan </m:mtext><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mi>e</m:mi>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>c</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>Bagi dengan </m:mtext><m:msup>
       <m:mi>e</m:mi>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mi>e</m:mi>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>c</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>Ambil resiprokalnya</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id2072882">Kemudian gunakan sifat-sifat logaritma.</para>
 <equation id="fs-id1408189" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mi>e</m:mi>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>c</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>ln</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>   </m:mtext><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>ln</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id1737662">Konstanta redamannya adalah <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mfrac>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mi>ln</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>)</m:mo>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mn>3</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mo>.</m:mo>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </para></solution>
</exercise></example>

</section>
<section id="fs-id2957014">
<title>Kurva Pembatas dalam Gerak Harmonik</title>
<para id="fs-id1158173">Grafik gerak harmonik dapat diapit oleh kurva-kurva pembatas. Ketika suatu fungsi memiliki <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00012">amplitudo</term>, sehingga amplitudonya naik dan turun beberapa kali dalam satu periode, kita dapat menentukan kurva pembatas dari salah satu bagian fungsi.</para>

<example id="Example_07_06_15">
<exercise id="fs-id2182326">
 <problem id="fs-id2182329"><title>Menggambar Kurva Kosinus yang Berosilasi</title>

  <para id="fs-id2591809">Gambarkan fungsi <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mi>x</m:mi>
     <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:math>
  </para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2322013">


 <para id="fs-id2628950">Grafik yang dihasilkan fungsi ini akan ditampilkan dalam dua bagian. Grafik pertama adalah fungsi eksak <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> (lihat <link target-id="Figure_07_07_015" />), sedangkan grafik kedua adalah fungsi eksak <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> ditambah kurva pembatas (lihat <link target-id="Figure_07_07_016" />). Kedua grafik tampak sangat berbeda.</para>

<figure id="Figure_07_07_015" class="small"><media id="fs-id1152766" alt="Grafik f(x) = cos(2pi*x)cos(16pi*x), fungsi sinusoidal yang amplitudonya naik dan turun secara periodik.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_07_015.jpg" />
</media>
</figure><figure id="Figure_07_07_016" class="small"><media id="fs-id1675994" alt="Grafik f(x) = cos(2pi*x)cos(16pi*x), fungsi sinusoidal yang amplitudonya naik dan turun secara periodik. Sebuah kurva pembatas juga digambar merah di atasnya, sehingga seluruh gambar tampak seperti potongan DNA (heliks ganda) yang direntangkan sepanjang sumbu x.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_07_016.jpg" />
</media>
</figure></solution>
<commentary id="fs-id3042059">
<title>Analisis </title>
 <para id="fs-id3038728">Kurva <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> dan <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:mrow>
 </m:math> merupakan kurva pembatas: keduanya membatasi fungsi dari atas dan bawah dengan menelusuri titik-titik tinggi dan rendahnya. Grafik gerak harmonik berada di antara kurva pembatas tersebut. Ini adalah contoh fungsi yang amplitudonya tidak hanya menurun terhadap waktu, tetapi benar-benar naik dan turun beberapa kali dalam satu periode.</para></commentary>
</exercise>
</example>

<note id="fs-id1403864" class="precalculus media media-notitle">
<label>Media</label>
<para id="fs-id2838123">Akses sumber daya daring berikut untuk memperoleh penjelasan dan latihan tambahan tentang penerapan trigonometri.</para>
<list id="fs-id2838126">
 <item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/solvetrigprob">Menyelesaikan Masalah dengan Trigonometri</link></item>
 <item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/ferriswheel">Trigonometri Bianglala</link></item>
 <item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/dailytemp">Suhu Harian dan Trigonometri</link></item>
 <item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/simpleharm">Gerak Harmonik Sederhana</link></item>

</list>
</note>
</section>
</section>
 <section id="fs-id3483144" class="key-equations"><title>Persamaan-Persamaan Utama</title><table id="fs-id2608518" summary=".." class="unnumbered unstyled"><label />
   <title />
   <tgroup cols="2">
    <colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
    <colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
    <tbody>
     <row>
      <entry align="center">Bentuk standar persamaan sinusoidal</entry>
      <entry align="center"> <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mtext>atau</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </entry>
     </row>

     <row>
      <entry align="center">Gerak harmonik sederhana</entry>
      <entry align="center"> <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>d</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>ω</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mtext>  atau  </m:mtext><m:mi>d</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>ω</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </entry>
     </row>
     <row>
      <entry align="center">Gerak harmonik teredam</entry>
      <entry align="center"> <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mi>t</m:mi>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:msup>
          <m:mi>e</m:mi>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow />
         <m:mi>t</m:mi>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>ω</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mtext>atau</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mi>t</m:mi>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:msup>
          <m:mi>e</m:mi>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
         </m:msup>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>ω</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </entry>
     </row>
    </tbody>
   </tgroup>
  </table>


 </section><section id="fs-id1157947" class="key-concepts">
  <title>Konsep-Konsep Utama</title>
  <list id="fs-id1793027"><item>Fungsi sinusoidal dinyatakan oleh grafik sinus dan kosinus. Dari bentuk standarnya, kita dapat menentukan amplitudo, periode, serta pergeseran horizontal dan vertikal. Lihat <link target-id="Example_07_06_01" /> dan <link target-id="Example_07_06_02" />.</item>
   <item>Gunakan titik-titik kunci untuk menggambar fungsi sinusoidal. Kelima titik kunci mencakup nilai minimum, nilai maksimum, dan nilai garis tengah. Lihat <link target-id="Example_07_06_03" />.</item>
   <item>Fungsi periodik dapat memodelkan peristiwa yang berulang dalam siklus tertentu, seperti fase Bulan, gerak jarum jam, dan musim-musim dalam setahun. Lihat <link target-id="Example_07_06_04" />, <link target-id="Example_07_06_06" />, <link target-id="Example_07_06_07" /> dan <link target-id="Example_07_06_08" />.</item>

   <item>Fungsi gerak harmonik dimodelkan dari data yang diberikan. Seperti penerapan gerak periodik, gerak harmonik memerlukan gaya pemulih. Contohnya meliputi gaya gravitasi dan gerak pegas yang digerakkan oleh beban. Lihat <link target-id="Example_07_06_09" />.</item>
   <item>Gerak harmonik teredam adalah bentuk perilaku periodik yang dipengaruhi oleh faktor redaman. Faktor yang mendisipasikan energi, seperti gesekan, menyebabkan simpangan benda menyusut. Lihat <link target-id="Example_07_06_10" />, <link target-id="Example_07_06_11" />, <link target-id="Example_07_06_12" />, <link target-id="Example_07_06_13" />, dan <link target-id="Example_07_06_14" />.</item>
   <item>Kurva pembatas menandai batas grafik gerak harmonik yang memiliki nilai maksimum dan minimum berubah-ubah. Lihat <link target-id="Example_07_06_15" />.</item></list>
 </section>
<section id="fs-id2091339" class="section-exercises"><title>Latihan Bagian</title><section id="fs-id2091342">
<title>Verbal</title>
<exercise id="fs-id2735684" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2735685"><para id="fs-id2735686">Jelaskan jenis fenomena fisik yang paling baik dimodelkan oleh fungsi sinusoidal. Karakteristik apa yang diperlukan?</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2735691">
<para id="fs-id1752331">Perilaku fisiknya harus periodik atau bersiklus.</para>
</solution></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1752335" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1752336"><para id="fs-id1752337">Informasi apa yang diperlukan untuk menyusun model trigonometri suhu harian? Berikan contoh dua kelompok informasi berbeda yang memungkinkan penyusunan model persamaan.</para></problem></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2294678" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2294679"><para id="fs-id2294680">Jika kita ingin memodelkan curah hujan kumulatif selama setahun, apakah fungsi sinusoidal merupakan model yang baik? Mengapa atau mengapa tidak?</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2294684">
<para id="fs-id2122286">Karena curah hujan kumulatif selalu meningkat, fungsi sinus tidak akan ideal di sini. </para>
</solution></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2122290" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2122291"><para id="fs-id2122292">Jelaskan pengaruh faktor redaman terhadap grafik fungsi gerak harmonik.</para></problem></exercise>

</section>
<section id="fs-id2451605">
<title>Aljabar </title>
<para id="fs-id2451610">Untuk latihan berikut, tentukan salah satu rumus yang mungkin untuk fungsi trigonometri yang dinyatakan oleh tabel nilai.</para>
